csl++

Parts of csl++ are derived from the examples of the Cerebras SDK, which
Cerebras Systems publishes at https://github.com/Cerebras/sdk-examples under
the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- libs/allreduce and libs/stencil_3d_7pts, from benchmarks/benchmark-libs,
  rewritten for csl++;
- test/Integration/coro-benchmarks/benchmark-libs-orig, a copy of
  benchmarks/benchmark-libs;
- the programs in test/Integration/non-coro-benchmarks and
  test/Integration/coro-benchmarks that carry the name of an SDK benchmark,
  modified for timing measurements and, in coro-benchmarks, rewritten with
  the language extensions of csl++.
